$bog_kit_app2 $bog_kit_app
	menu_title \Kit
	Theme $bog_kit_plotter
	menu_tools /
		<= Lights_pick $bog_kit_lights_pick
	Intro_text $mol_text
		text \
			\# The same catalogue, drawn by the Kit
			\
			\Nothing in the pages changed. `$bog_kit_app2` inherits the whole
			\catalogue from `$bog_kit_app` and hands it a context where the stock
			\components have been swapped for their Kit subclasses, so every
			\button, field and card on every page is re-drawn without a page
			\being touched.
			\
			\Open `../app/-/` in another tab to compare.
